   Engine: DataFusion
   Execution Mode: Serial
   Local Engine Peak Memory Bytes: 4192
   ->  Sort
         Sort Key: l.key ASC NULLS LAST
         ->  Aggregate
               Group Key: l.key
               Aggregates: COUNT(*)
               ->  Hash Join
                     Join Type: Inner
                     Hash Cond: l.key = r.key
                     ->  Table Scan on query_offload_explain_left l
                           Access Method: iceberg
                           Actual Input Batches: 2
                           Actual Input Rows: 3
                           Scan Tasks: 1
                           Data Files Selected: 1
                           Selected File Bytes: 1293
                     ->  Table Scan on query_offload_explain_right r
                           Access Method: iceberg
                           Actual Input Batches: 1
                           Actual Input Rows: 2
                           Scan Tasks: 1
                           Data Files Selected: 1
                           Selected File Bytes: 931
(26 rows)

